---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="NUS Fintech Summit 2025 - Ryan Darius Lim">
    <div class="ux-projects" style="padding-top: 80px;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-header">
                    <div class="project-title-row">
                        <img src="/fintech_logo.png" alt="NUS Fintech Society logo" class="project-logo">
                        <h3 class="project-title">NUS Fintech Summit 2025</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="project-role">Vice President | Spearheaded Business Development + Marketing</p>
                    <p class="project-dates">2024 – 2025</p>
                </div>

                <div class="project-content">
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Project Overview</h4>
                        <p>
                            I led external relations of the society, involving visual design and marketing for NUS Fintech Summit 2025, 
                            a major conference featuring industry leaders from Coinbase, Ripple, Northern Trust, Jane Street, NVIDIA, Bank of America, Taisu Ventures and many more.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            <strong>Key Achievement: </strong> <br>Developed $135,000 in sponsorships and created a marketing campaign 
                            that doubled sign-ups compared to the previous year.
                        </p>
                        <div style="margin: 20px 0;">
                            <a href="https://nusfintechsummit.com/" target="_blank" 
                               style="display: inline-block; background: #0366d6; color: white; padding: 12px 28px; 
                                      border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; 
                                      transition: background 0.2s;">
                                🚀 Launch the NUS Fintech Summit website
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Design Challenge</h4>
                        <p>Create a cohesive visual identity that would:</p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Appeal to both students and industry professionals across different backgrounds (schools, seniority, gender, industries of fintech)</li>
                            <li>Communicate innovation and growth in the fintech space</li>
                            <li>Work seamlessly across digital (social media, website) and print materials</li>
                            <li>Stand out in a crowded student event landscape with memorable branding</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Design Approach</h4>
                        <p><strong>Visual Concept:</strong> Mountain/Summit Theme representing the journey and aspiration in fintech.</p>
                        
                        <p style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><strong>Design Deliverables:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Social media campaign with countdown posts and speaker announcements building anticipation</li>
                            <li>Multi-page event PDF with detailed schedules and speaker profiles for comprehensive information</li>
                            <li>Ticket-style branding creating memorable visual identity and collectible appeal</li>
                            <li>Professional speaker profile cards with company logos establishing credibility</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="project-image">
                        <img src="/fintech_summit-2.png" alt="NUS Fintech Summit opening day details">
                    </div>

                    <div class="project-image">
                        <img src="/fintech_summit-1.png" alt="NUS Fintech Summit countdown design">
                    </div>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Design Decisions</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Color Psychology</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Used blue tones to convey trust and professionalism in financial services, 
                                    with gradient accents suggesting innovation and technology.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Visual Hierarchy</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Used strategic sizing, color contrast, and positioning to guide eye flow and emphasize 
                                    the most important information at each touchpoint.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Accessibility</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Ensured high contrast ratios and readable font sizes across all materials, making 
                                    the design inclusive and easy to read.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Brand Consistency</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Maintained consistent color palette and mountain visual motifs across all materials 
                                    for strong, recognizable brand identity.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Typography Choices</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Selected modern sans-serif fonts that balanced professionalism with approachability, 
                                    ensuring readability across digital and print media.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Social Media Optimization</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Designed assets specifically for Instagram, LinkedIn, and other platforms with 
                                    platform-specific sizing and engagement-focused layouts.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="project-image">
                        <img src="/fintech_summit-3.png" alt="NUS Fintech Summit panel discussion details">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Business Development -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Business Development Strategy</h4>
                        
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Sponsorship Acquisition ($135,000):</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Identified and researched potential sponsors aligned with fintech themes and student interests</li>
                            <li>Created compelling sponsorship decks highlighting audience demographics, engagement metrics, and brand visibility opportunities</li>
                            <li>Managed relationships with major companies including banks, fintech unicorns, and tech giants</li>
                            <li>Negotiated tiered sponsorship packages balancing value delivery and budget optimization</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p style="margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Partner Engagement:</strong></p>
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li>Coordinated with speakers from Coinbase, Ripple, Northern Trust, Jane Street, NVIDIA, and Bank of America</li>
                            <li>Ensured smooth logistics and communication for all partnership activations</li>
                            <li>Maintained long-term relationships for future collaborations and society growth</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Marketing Campaign -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Marketing Campaign Strategy</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Multi-Channel Approach</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Deployed coordinated campaign across Instagram, LinkedIn, email newsletters, 
                                    and campus activations for maximum reach.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Content Calendar</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Created strategic posting schedule with countdown posts, speaker spotlights, 
                                    and engagement-driving content leading up to the event.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Community Building</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Fostered excitement and anticipation through interactive posts, Q&A sessions, 
                                    and behind-the-scenes content.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Conversion Optimization</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Designed clear CTAs and streamlined registration process, removing friction 
                                    from sign-up to attendance.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Marketing Impact</h4>
                        
                        <div class="feature-grid">
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">2x Sign-up Rate</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Doubled participant registrations compared to previous summit through targeted marketing campaign.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">$135,000 Sponsorships</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Secured substantial industry sponsorships from major fintech companies through professional branding.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Strong Brand Recognition</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Established NUS Fintech Society as a prominent voice in Singapore's fintech student community.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="feature-box">
                                <div class="feature-title">Cross-School Reach</div>
                                <div class="feature-description">
                                    Attracted attendees from NUS, NTU, SMU, and international universities, 
                                    expanding the society's network.
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Key Learnings -->
                    <div class="content-section">
                        <h4 class="content-section-title">Key Learnings</h4>
                        
                        <ul class="simple-list">
                            <li><strong>Design for Multiple Stakeholders:</strong> Created visual identity that resonated with both corporate sponsors (professionalism) and students (innovation and accessibility)</li>
                            <li><strong>Integrated Marketing & Design:</strong> Aligned visual design with marketing strategy to create cohesive campaign that amplified both elements</li>
                            <li><strong>Relationship Management:</strong> Built strong partnerships with sponsors through clear communication, value delivery, and professional execution</li>
                            <li><strong>Data-Driven Iteration:</strong> Used engagement metrics and sign-up data to refine messaging and creative throughout the campaign</li>
                            <li><strong>Scale & Leadership:</strong> Managed multiple workstreams (design, BD, marketing) simultaneously while coordinating a team of volunteers</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="tools">
                        <span class="tool-tag">Graphic Design</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Brand Identity</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Marketing Strategy</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Event Promotion</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Social Media Marketing</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Business Development</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Client Relationship Management</span>
                        <span class="tool-tag">Sponsorship Management</span>
                    </div>

                    <div style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 2px solid #e1e4e8;">
                        <a href="/projects" style="color: #0366d6; font-weight: 600;">← Back to All Projects</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
